            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.70</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Collections in the project list.</b> Agent-created collections appear under a project's folders — click to view, right-click to delete. Copies made from collections keep their original model and prompt labels.</li>
<li><b>New PROMPTR look.</b> The default theme now uses our brand colors, with a more readable prompt editor in light mode.</li>
<li><b>Note:</b> This update is signed with our new company certificate — macOS may ask you to sign in again once.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
